<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding <em><strong>&lt;enter details&gt;</strong></em>.
<p><strong><em>-If lower tier received upgrade add-</em></strong><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that we were unable to meet your request for an upgrade on your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
I can understand your confusion when your <strong><em>-colleague/wife/husband/travelling companion etc-</em></strong> was upgraded instead. I’ve checked your booking and can assure you that your upgrade request was not ignored.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If points taken for upgrade not provided add-</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Your points have been refunded</strong><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that we were unable to meet your request for an upgrade on your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
I can understand your confusion when your points were mistakenly deducted. I’ve spoken with our Frequent Flyer Service Centre and can confirm the Qantas Points have now been refunded.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>-If empty seats add-</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Empty Business Class seats</strong><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that we were unable to meet your request for an upgrade on your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}. I can understand your confusion when you saw that seats were available in the Business Class cabin.<br />
<br />
I’ve checked your booking and wanted to assure you that your upgrade request was taken into consideration.<br />
<br />
Empty seats on your flight can be the result of seats that were sold and subsequently not used by late arrivals to the airport, delayed connections, or customers who cancelled their seats after the upgrade requests were processed.<br />
<br />
We realise that this is an area of frustration, and we are continually reviewing our process.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for telling us about your experience, we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
